{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108619","id":2665482648,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6e4AmY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108619","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108619","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108619/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108619/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108619/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1c65bdec1623475254cdcdf800648de448a1ae6f","number":108619,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"C# - `StringExtensions` improvements","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This pull request makes a number of improvements (bug fixes, performance improvements, simplicity/clarity improvements) I found to `StringExtensions` in C#.\r\n\r\n- Replaced calls `RFind(string)` with constant single-char string to `LastIndexOf(char)`. Benchmarks suggest this is nearly 2x faster (19.02ns -> 10.53ns)\r\n- Consistency improvements to certain documentation comments.\r\n- Replaced `Mathf.Max(rs.RFind(\"/\"), rs.RFind(\"\\\\\"));` with `rs.AsSpan().LastIndexOfAny('/', '\\\\');`. `AsSpan` must be used for performance since `LastIndexOfAny` on strings only take an array.\r\n- Replaced `!= -1` with `< 0`, including the `from` parameter for `RFind`. This matches the C++ implementation.\r\n- Replaced `a == b || a == c` with `a is b or c`, both for clarity and to fix a bug. `IsValidHexNumber` currently considers `-` valid but not `+`, due to a precedence bug with `||` and `&&`.\r\n- Replaced custom local `IsHexDigit` function with `char.IsAsciiHexDigit`, both for simplicity and also because the current implementation uses `char.IsDigit` rather than `char.IsAsciiDigit`, which is presumably incorrect since it would accept non-ASCII numbers in the hex number like the Japanese １２３ full-width numerals.\r\n- Replaced `IndexOfAny(...) == -1` with `!AsSpan().ContainsAny(...)` for clarity. I also changed the array to a `SearchValues` because C# was giving a warning to change to it for performance.\r\n- Replaced `IsValidInt` + `ToInt` + bounds check with `byte.TryParse` and `ushort.TryParse` for simplicity and performance.\r\n- Optimized `JSONEscape` by avoiding multiple passes. Benchmarks suggest this is nearly 5x faster (339.79ns -> 74.15ns, 384B -> 288B)\r\n- Added `RFind` overload with `char` to match the `Find` overload with `char`. These could also be added to e.g. `RFindN` but you would have to add it to `FindN` as well.\r\n- Replaced some seemingly pointless code in `ValidateNodeName` with something simpler and more performant.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labe